Root cause:
The bug was caused by the absence of the "counting.c" example file in the libperf package, which was referenced in the man pages. This omission led to confusion for users who expected to find the file as part of the documentation, resulting in a lack of practical examples for using the libperf library. The patch addresses this by adding the missing file to the package.
